<section class="faq-preview-section section-spacing">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header-with-action reveal">
      <div>
        <span class="section-eyebrow">FAQ</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">Common questions</h2>
      </div>
      <a href="/pages/faq" class="section-action-link">
        All FAQs <span class="arrow">→</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-preview-grid reveal">
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-question">
          <span>What does "tested surplus" mean?</span>
          <svg class="faq-icon" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none">
            <path d="M5 7.5L10 12.5L15 7.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          </svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>Surplus hardware is genuine manufacturer equipment from verified channels. We test every unit for hashrate, thermals, and stability before shipping.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-question">
          <span>Do you offer firmware configuration?</span>
          <svg class="faq-icon" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none">
            <path d="M5 7.5L10 12.5L15 7.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          </svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>Yes! We can pre-configure units with Vnish OS or Braiins OS at no extra charge. Just select your preferred option at checkout.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-question">
          <span>How fast do you ship?</span>
          <svg class="faq-icon" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none">
            <path d="M5 7.5L10 12.5L15 7.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          </svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>Most orders ship within 48 hours from our USA warehouse. Freight shipping typically takes 3-5 business days domestically.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-question">
          <span>Can I order wholesale quantities?</span>
          <svg class="faq-icon" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none">
            <path d="M5 7.5L10 12.5L15 7.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          </svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>Absolutely. We maintain pallet inventory for facility deployments. Contact our sales team for volume pricing on 10+ units.</p>
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "FAQ Preview",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "FAQ Preview"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
